{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o049a","title":"曹操论功增荀攸邑转中军师","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o049a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"曹操论功增荀攸邑转中军师","evidence":["xunyu-e-o049a-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p040-judgment","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》载曹操过荀攸舍称其劳勋，愿其自择封邑。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p040-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"封赏","evidence":["xunyu-e-o049a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0143","role":"受任","evidence":["xunyu-e-o049a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":207,"label":"建安十二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y207","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o028","basis":"建安十二年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o049a-q","xunyu-q-o028","xunyu-q-b-9e8657a8d99677366046"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o049a-q","source_order":[10,233,"O049a"],"order":2497}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0143","name":"荀攸","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o049a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-f462a8b58ae71795a94a","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖5〗，下令大论功行封。太祖曰：“忠正密谋，抚宁内外；文若是也，公达其次也。”增邑四百，并前七百户；﹝一﹞转为中军师。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-9e8657a8d99677366046","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9e8657a8d99677366046","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3e089bebb7a045763aaa","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xunyu-q-o028","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-99f47b5b20670984f53c","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖5〗，复增彧邑千户，合二千户。﹝二﹞太祖将伐刘表，问彧策安出。彧曰：“今华夏已平〖6〗，南土知困矣〖7〗。可显出宛、叶，而间行轻进，以掩其不意。”太祖遂行。会表病死，太祖直趋宛、叶，如彧计。表子琮，以州逆降〖8〗。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"xunyu-q-p040-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-14f5e9220c7eca8c81ef","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“太祖自柳城还，过攸舍，称述攸前后谋谟劳勋，曰：‘今天下事，略已定矣；孤愿与贤士大夫，共飨其劳。昔高祖使张子房自择邑三万户，今孤亦欲君自择所封焉。’”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-95e4d99da29f8d2f985b","start":0,"end":84}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
